  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Development Programme for Women in the Eparchy of Keren</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance women&apos;s capacity to challenge negative customs and beliefs about women&apos;s roles and capacities.
To reduce the stress and sense of isolation that women experience, particularly as a result of the recent war.
To enable women to earn some income to support themselves and their families.
To build the capacity of the teachers and sisters in charge of the women&apos;s centres so that their work with women is more creative and effective.</narrative>
  </description>
